{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は15thシングルの\n初 個別握手会でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/26/1768422/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごーくたくさんの方が\n会場に来てくださっててびっくり！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日の生誕祭は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部終わり 中田\n2部終わり 飛鳥\n3部終わり まいやん\n4部終わり 真夏\n5部終わり さゆりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は多いね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/26/1768422/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらく個別が無かったから\n実際の誕生日と比べると\n中田なんかは2か月弱後だったのですね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでもやってくださるのは\n本当にありがたいことです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の生誕祭では\nまさかのみり愛ちゃんが\n手紙を読んでくれたんです！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/26/1768422/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/26/1768422/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/26/1768422/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだたくさんの方が\n来てくださってたけど\n映しきれなくてごめんねえ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/26/1768422/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕委員の皆様、ありがとうございます\nお疲れ様でした～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊髪型"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1～3部\nゆる巻き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部では生誕委員の方が用意してくださった\n花冠もつけてました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4・5部\n低めポニーテール"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/26/1768422/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊私服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1・2部\nハイネック: Honey Salon by foppish\nレオパードミニ:KIKKA THE DIARY OF"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部\n生誕Tシャツ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんと双子？コーデでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/26/1768422/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4・5部\nご好評につき\nギタヒロの時と同じコーデ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊会話"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日\nアンダーライブ\nMステ\n沈金\n乃木中\n真夏の全国ツアー\nモバメ200通\nのぎ天2\nゴルフ\nカナヲ\n株\nアイドル\nブログ、モバメ、755\netc."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ後で\n何故か昨日は寝つけなくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はぐったりかなって思ってたら\nなんかいつも以上に元気でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/26/1768422/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナチュラルハイなのかと思ったけど\n夜までずっとだったから\n普通に元気だったのかも！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気遣いありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた皆様、\n本当にありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/i